				},
				"string" : "Create a Mondrian view with a force-based layout of an author, and all their reachable papers and co-authors. Represent each author as a light blue square with size proportional to the number of authored papers, and with authors initials (given name and surname) as the centred label. Hovering over the author box should show the full author name. Represent papers as light pink circles with their size proportional to the number of authors. Hovering over a paper should show its title. Clicking on a node will navigate to the paper or author."
			},
